          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 150,
          "diagram": "b1-e25-school-uniforms",
          "text": "A school is thinking about changing its rules about clothes. Here are some ideas. Talk together about the different ideas, and say which would be the best for the school.",
          "audio": "audio/B1/b1-e25-school-uniforms/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 11000
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about clothes and school life.",
